73
00:04:17.421 --> 00:04:20.029
So why does God care about all this?

74
00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:23.800
Well, they're not common anymore. They're holy. They're separated to him.

75
00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.120
So here's what I want to tell you. If you're going to journey deeper into the

76
