your time, your routines, your roles, your possessions, your

83
00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:53.660
car, your job, your money, your wife, your budget, your kids, your

84
00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.720
relationships, your jokes, your emotions, your thoughts,

85
00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.660
there is nothing in your life God can't talk to

