If you're busy assuming that some things are over on this side of the line

92
00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.200
and you're putting part of your life over here and part of it over here,

93
00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.840
you need to rethink that. It's just not going to work.

94
00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.510
It's all got to be over here. It's all on this side

95
00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.580
because nothing is common anymore.

96
00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:38.370
You've got to learn to put a difference between the common and the

97
00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:38.780
holy.

98
00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.260
So in your life,

99
00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.920
maybe you just need to rethink what it looks like for you to be a

100
00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.620
person who is really fully

