106
00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.670
It's holy. It belongs to the Lord.

107
00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.200
So I want you to spend some time today just kind of mulling that over.

108
00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:15.880
Do the questions in the workbook because I hope that they will help you

